<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Robert Chaplinsky raised his fiscal year 1998 estimate for Xilinx Inc to $1.87 from $1.80, citing strong March quarter performance.</p>
</text>
